  "body": "Secure this 447sqm (approx.) flat section in a quality Orewa neighbourhood, with beautiful sea views already visible from ground level.\r\n\r\nThe hard work is done - RC and BC are approved, title is issued, and you can start building straight away.\r\n\r\nThe approved plan features 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, a study and separate playroom, ideal for modern family living.\r\n\r\nClose to Orewa Beach, cafés, schools, shops and motorway access, this is a rare opportunity to build your dream home without the usual delays.\r\n\r\nSea views. Flat section. Consents approved. Ready to build.\r\n\r\nContact Rachel today for more information.",
